<section
  class="loreal-chapter"
  id="loreal-create"
  aria-labelledby="create-chapter"
>
  {{> sections/case-chapter-heading chapter}}

  <div class="wrap loreal-section-heading">
    <h3 id="create-title">Creativity takes centre stage.</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap loreal-filmstrip-controls">
    <span>Drag to explore <span aria-hidden="true">↔</span></span>
    <div>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-filmstrip-prev
        aria-label="Previous stage photograph"
        aria-controls="loreal-filmstrip"
      >
        ←</button
      ><button
        type="button"
        data-filmstrip-next
        aria-label="Next stage photograph"
        aria-controls="loreal-filmstrip"
      >
        →
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div
    class="loreal-create-images"
    id="loreal-filmstrip"
    tabindex="0"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Stage design photographs"
  >
    {{#each createImages}}
    <figure>
      {{> pages/case-study-loreal/image this sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw,
      66vw"}}
      <figcaption>{{caption}}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    {{/each}}
  </div>
  <div class="wrap loreal-regions">
    <article>
      <span class="cue">London / The O2</span>
      <h3>UK Grand Final</h3>
      <p>
        For the UK Grand Final, the traditional competition format was
        reimagined around an ambitious 50 m catwalk and 360 degree in-the-round
        stage, placing finalists at the centre of the experience. Dynamic
        lighting, video, lasers and special effects created an immersive setting
        for the competition and its celebration of creativity and craftsmanship.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="cue">Dublin</span>
      <h3>Ireland Final</h3>
      <p>
        For the Ireland Final, a bespoke black gloss thrust stage brought models
        further into the audience. Venue branding, a custom judging system and
        an interactive foil selfie booth completed the experience.
      </p>
      <p>
        Both productions followed the Chroma creative vision while reflecting
        the character and practical requirements of their venues.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap loreal-create-services">
    <a class="loreal-service-link" href="creative-content.html"
      >Creative &amp; content ↗</a
    >
  </div>
  <div class="loreal-ticker" data-ticker style="--ticker-colour:{{chapter.colour}}">
    <div class="loreal-ticker-track">
      <ul class="loreal-ticker-list" aria-label="Creative and content services">
        {{#each createServices}}
        <li>{{this}}</li>
        {{/each}}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
